OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen leaves 3,000 homes
OL,4,Awithout power in Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of homes have been left
OL,7,Fwithout power as Storm Austen hits
OL,8,FWales.
OL,10,FNational Grid has reported that more
OL,11,Fthan 3,000 homes are without power
OL,12,Fbetween Milford Haven, Pembrokeshire,
OL,13,Fand Usk, Monmouthshire.
OL,15,FHundreds more lost power on Friday, but
OL,16,Fhave since been reconnected.
OL,18,FThe biggest outage is in Cardigan,
OL,19,Fwhere more than 500 homes have been
OL,20,Faffected.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
